{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"Intake ceremony where Rue sold herself, signed the Contract, and was recorded in the Folio; Headmistress stated that only three of the hundred intakes leave after ten years.","participants":["char-rue","loc-ceremony-hall","char-headmistress"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"Contract signed by Rue specifying a ten-year term; witnessed by Headmistress (mark beside signature).","participants":["obj-contract","char-rue"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"Rue sold herself into the Mercy Academy by signing the Contract during the intake ceremony; the Contract specifies a ten-year term and was witnessed by the Headmistress; the Folio records intake and serves as institutional record.","participants":["char-rue","obj-contract","obj-folio","char-headmistress"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"Rue is part of the intake described as 'one hundred' entrants; seating and phrasing place her among that year's group.","participants":["char-rue","group-the-hundred"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"The Folio contains an intake template with fields for Name, Age, Date, Intake (One hundred), Provenance, Signature, Witness; it functions as the Academy's official record and law for entrants.","participants":["obj-folio"],"location":null}
