{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"Intake template in the Folio explicitly lists Intake: One hundred.","participants":["group-the-hundred","obj-folio"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"Rue consented to the Contract and understands she is bound by its term.","participants":["char-rue"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"The Headmistress acted as witness by making a mark beside Rue's signature during the signing of the Contract.","participants":["char-rue","char-headmistress","obj-contract"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-002","when":null,"summary":"A thin intake list transcribed from the Folio was posted at the dormitory entry for newcomers to see; the full Folio is later taken to the Archive.","participants":["loc-dormitory","obj-folio"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-002","when":null,"summary":"The Bell signals meals, lessons, and curfew for dormitory routine; the Bell schedule structures daily life.","participants":["obj-bell","loc-dormitory"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-002","when":null,"summary":"Lin, Mara and Kela meet Rue; Lin helps with packing, Mara warns not to trust the board, Kela notes chores and rota.","participants":["loc-dormitory","char-lin","char-mara","char-kela"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-002","when":null,"summary":"Rota posted beneath intake list specifies chores: garden, laundry, kitchen, sweeping, mending, errands for the scribe; rota visible to residents.","participants":["loc-dormitory"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-002","when":null,"summary":"A small social circle forms: Lin shares bread and packing tips; Mara tells a cautionary tale about bargaining out a rota and being punished in the scullery; Kela advises keeping head down and hands busy.","participants":["loc-dormitory","char-mara","char-kela","char-lin","char-rue"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-002","when":null,"summary":"The dormitory closes at curfew with trunks under bunks and a household-like folding in; the board shows names in neat column, giving Rue domestic relief.","participants":["loc-dormitory"],"location":null}
