{"scene":"s-001","when":null,"summary":"(Draft) Intake ceremony in which Rue signs a ten-year Contract, marks provenance as 'sold', the Folio is closed and declared record and law, the Contract is sealed with wax and signet, and the Amber Bell is rung.","participants":["char-rue","loc-great-hall","obj-folio","obj-contract","char-headmistress","obj-binding-seal","obj-amber-bell"],"location":"loc-great-hall"}
